    '1aa36213cb676fd5baad5edc2bee4fbe117a778b' => ['name' => 'Researchers (Alliance)', 'description' => '+ 10% hastighet till expeditionsdestinationen<br />+5%större planeter vid kolonosation<br />Tillgång till systemfalang: för 40000 deuterium kan detta användas för att skanna flottorörelser i hela system, så länge dessa är inom räckhåll.', 'duration_label' => 'för 40000 deuterium kan detta användas för att skanna flottorörelser i hela system, så länge dessa är inom räckhåll.', 'extended_description' => 'De största upptäckterna görs när många stora hjärnor arbetar tillsammans. En allians av forskare upptäcker inte bara större planeter att kolonisera, utan deras fartyg är också snabbare på expeditioner. Tillsammans har de tillgång till systemet falang, som kan användas för att skanna flottorörelser i hela system.'],
    '6c9fe5e35bdad0d4e3382eb6a5aeac6bc8263752' => ['name' => 'Traders (Alliance)', 'description' => '+10% hastighet för transporterare<br />+5% produktion på resurser och energi<br />+10% lagringskapacitet på månar och planeter', 'duration_label' => 'Permanent', 'extended_description' => 'Handelsallianser är givande för alla inblandade parter, och ingen vet det bättre än en allians av näringsidkare. Deras transportörer flyger snabbare och processerna för energi- och resursproduktion har optimerats så att de kan tjäna stora pengar. Med sin förbättrade logistik har de också mer lagring på sina planeter och månar.'],
    '9b48e257cbef6c5df0f03a47cead7f9abda3d437' => ['name' => 'Warriors (Alliance)', 'description' => '+10% hastighet för fartyg som flyger mellan alliansmedlemmar<br />+1 stridsforskningsnivå<br />+1 spionageforskningsnivå<br />Tillgång till spionagesystem: skickar det valda antalet spionagesonder för att skanna ett helt system. Du kan ställa in vilken typ av himmelkropp som ska undersökas, tiden sedan den senaste spionattacken eller önskad spelaraktivitet.', 'duration_label' => 'skickar det valda antalet spionagesonder för att skanna ett helt system. Du kan ställa in vilken typ av himmelkropp som ska undersökas, tiden sedan den senaste spionattacken eller önskad spelaraktivitet.', 'extended_description' => 'Ibland måste de mest kraftfulla krigare göra en pakt för att härska över galaxen tillsammans. Spionageteknologin som är tillgänglig för en sådan union gör det lättare för dem att identifiera värdiga mål för sina erövringar. Tillsammans är deras teknik ännu starkare och de är redo för vad som helst.'],
    'dc34fa00ba914ffab0031ac3f165e26f553d7809' => ['name' => 'Avatar: Laser Cat', 'description' => 'Select this avatar in your player profile to apply it and give your profile a personal touch. This item will be unlocked for all universes on your account. Please note that the synchronisation between universes may take some time.', 'duration_label' => 'Permanent', 'extended_description' => 'Cats and lasers are an inseparable combo – now you can deck your profile out with the best of both!'],
    '1c497ef926d674f2df9d96cfc58fe12f97cf4025' => ['name' => 'Avatar: Little Alien', 'description' => 'Select this avatar in your player profile to apply it and give your profile a personal touch. This item will be unlocked for all universes on your account. Please note that the synchronisation between universes may take some time.', 'duration_label' => 'Permanent', 'extended_description' => 'New forms of intelligent life are constantly being discovered in the vast reaches of outer space. Many of them are completely different to humans, with their own strengths and weaknesses.'],
    'fd3b0789b5dca99e9d5b251f8bae0760ce52dea6' => ['name' => 'Avatar: Augmented', 'description' => 'Select this avatar in your player profile to apply it and give your profile a personal touch. This item will be unlocked for all universes on your account. Please note that the synchronisation between universes may take some time.', 'duration_label' => 'Permanent', 'extended_description' => 'Science has long overcome the limits of the fragile human body. Implants and other hi-tech augments allow you to become faster, tougher and stronger than others.'],
    '003db2a3d693c2d889864b76ad122b274bfd641b' => ['name' => 'Avatar: Weightless', 'description' => 'Select this avatar in your player profile to apply it and give your profile a personal touch. This item will be unlocked for all universes on your account. Please note that the synchronisation between universes may take some time.', 'duration_label' => 'Permanent', 'extended_description' => 'The first spacewalk is a major milestone in every young astronaut’s career, no matter what species. That feeling of floating alone among the stars, looking down on your tiny home planet, will stay with you for the rest of your days.'],
    '8d514b69eb04a57495bab0c8f4b80f58294a7b17' => ['name' => 'Avatar: Ice Cold', 'description' => 'Select this avatar in your player profile to apply it and give your profile a personal touch. This item will be unlocked for all universes on your account. Please note that the synchronisation between universes may take some time.', 'duration_label' => 'Permanent', 'extended_description' => 'Ice planets are valued for their rich Deuterium deposits, but sometimes it can be necessary to increase the security detail. Who knows what’s lurking out there among all that ice and snow…'],
    '83c4e79697a264462e3ca2e8567307e7f1d7954b' => ['name' => 'Avatar: Cyberspace', 'description' => 'Select this avatar in your player profile to apply it and give your profile a personal touch. This item will be unlocked for all universes on your account. Please note that the synchronisation between universes may take some time.', 'duration_label' => 'Permanent', 'extended_description' => 'Many young guns for hire who hope to earn their fortunes among the stars develop a style all of their own over the course of their careers. That helps them to earn a reputation, and increase their standing in more dubious circles.'],
    '2d7de180f3f3d191982294d2f8c1cd7507e90cb4' => ['name' => 'Avatar: Retro Kitties', 'description' => 'Select this avatar in your player profile to apply it and give your profile a personal touch. This item will be unlocked for all universes on your account. Please note that the synchronisation between universes may take some time.', 'duration_label' => 'Permanent', 'extended_description' => 'Legends speak of an adorably cute kitten that trails rainbows behind it as it flies through the endless reaches of space. Some debunkers have tried to explain away the myths as nothing more than a problem with the cockpit’s gas filtration system, but who knows…'],
    'c54d5a8f36f20373c5bb633a109241290b2e2a7a' => ['name' => 'Avatar: Warbringer', 'description' => 'Select this avatar in your player profile to apply it and give your profile a personal touch. This item will be unlocked for all universes on your account. Please note that the synchronisation between universes may take some time.', 'duration_label' => 'Permanent', 'extended_description' => 'Those who rule with an iron fist are often very mindful of cultivating a dangerous persona. People coming to petition them or pay tribute should immediately recognise who they’re dealing with.'],
    '99f53568108115acac2d7f7425ee2ad76a6206b8' => ['name' => 'Avatar: Commander Kitty', 'description' => 'Select this avatar in your player profile to apply it and give your profile a personal touch. This item will be unlocked for all universes on your account. Please note that the synchronisation between universes may take some time.', 'duration_label' => 'Permanent', 'extended_description' => 'Quick reflexes can be a boon to any space ruler, while a cute appearance often belies the cunning mind between those pointy ears.'],
    'c70f11e9543100622e3ef3bdcd57099a63f148bf' => ['name' => 'Avatar: Fate', 'description' => 'Select this avatar in your player profile to apply it and give your profile a personal touch. This item will be unlocked for all universes on your account. Please note that the synchronisation between universes may take some time.', 'duration_label' => 'Permanent', 'extended_description' => 'Myriad are the conflicts that across the vast reaches of space have been settled by the roll of a D20. The faces of this die are blank – what decisions will it make?'],
    'ac5bd99552a23733f7b0decac45094d5bfbfedac' => ['name' => 'Avatar: Burning Rage', 'description' => 'Select this avatar in your player profile to apply it and give your profile a personal touch. This item will be unlocked for all universes on your account. Please note that the synchronisation between universes may take some time.', 'duration_label' => 'Permanent', 'extended_description' => 'Some rulers among the stars strike fear into man’s hearts wherever their fleets are sighted. Only a fool would provoke their anger.'],
    'da8b1dcf6a9defb45e456968d3c8587bf63a48b5' => ['name' => 'Limited Avatar: Event Horizon', 'description' => 'Select this avatar in your player profile to apply it and give your profile a personal touch. This item will be unlocked for all universes on your account. Please note that the synchronisation between universes may take some time.', 'duration_label' => 'Permanent', 'extended_description' => 'As it turns out, that old explorer’s adage about boldly going over the horizon has its limits when it comes to space travel...'],
    '69719df021ec40424225f22e2edca15b799401a5' => ['name' => 'Limited Avatar: Star Pilot', 'description' => 'Select this avatar in your player profile to apply it and give your profile a personal touch. This item will be unlocked for all universes on your account. Please note that the synchronisation between universes may take some time.', 'duration_label' => 'Permanent', 'extended_description' => 'It is the most talented shipmates, the sharpest pilots, and the greatest minds who carry humanity’s legacy far beyond the stars.'],
    'facb9419f24c4a1fbff7dc29376c3f57c6204c1c' => ['name' => 'Limited Avatar: Android', 'description' => 'Select this avatar in your player profile to apply it and give your profile a personal touch. This item will be unlocked for all universes on your account. Please note that the synchronisation between universes may take some time.', 'duration_label' => 'Permanent', 'extended_description' => 'Fully mechanical crews can be particularly advantageous in hostile environments. They also require less cargo space for rations, while rapid charging tech mean that recuperation at the charging station takes less time than conventional sleep. And since the introduction of advanced battery systems, none of them has to suffer the indignity of being tethered to a charging cable, even on ice planets.'],
    '74bf9741209dc8ef4f9996b8b2b7ca59001ea3a8' => ['name' => 'Limited Avatar: Star Turtle', 'description' => 'Select this avatar in your player profile to apply it and give your profile a personal touch. This item will be unlocked for all universes on your account. Please note that the synchronisation between universes may take some time.', 'duration_label' => 'Permanent', 'extended_description' => 'While the existence of star turtles remains a controversial topic among experts, the rumours stubbornly persist. Reports of sightings regularly link the species to pachyderms, flat celestial bodies, and all kinds of other oddities...'],
    '07a4b64949fcc593435cfaa9184290af96ffdc29' => ['name' => 'Limited Avatar: Fate’s Anvil', 'description' => 'Select this avatar in your player profile to apply it and give your profile a personal touch. This item will be unlocked for all universes on your account. Please note that the synchronisation between universes may take some time.', 'duration_label' => 'Permanent', 'extended_description' => 'Every emperor holds the fate of their galactic empire in their own hands. You forge this fate yourself, as it is your talent and foresight that decides between victory and defeat.'],
